                     <msItem>
                       <note>
                          Rubrics in Old Provençal, e. g. fol. 48v (heading of 3 psalms for Tuesdays and Fridays); fol. 59r (headings for Wednesdays and Saturdays); fols 156v, 
                        168v, 177v and 186r; fol. 209r (virtues of St Augustine's prayer 'O dulcissime'); fol. 218r ('Confitemini domino' with Gloria after each verse); 
                        fol. 227v (virtues of St Augustine's prayer); fol. 231r (heading of another prayer of Augustine's). Also later Old Provençal additions to the Calendar
                       </note>
                        
                     </msItem>
                     
